  "Strength": {
   "summary": "The ability to push and pull things and to lift heavy objects.",
   "detail": "The ability to push and pull things and to lift heavy objects. This is purely muscle strength and includes things like breaking down a door, pushing someone, lifting rocks or weights, carrying something, or working for long periods of time, and also punching or hitting someone and blocking or taking a punch."
  },
  "Agility": {
   "summary": "The ability to move your body, being flexible and graceful.",
   "detail": "The ability to move your body, being flexible and graceful. This includes jumping, climbing, dodging an attack, and sneaking past someone, how well you can move in a fight including escaping, and how fast you can run, or walk away. This also includes aspects such as squeezing through tight openings, dancing, gymnastics, and performing martial arts."
  },
